Floor covering options for shops:

<strong>Linoleum</strong> is the most popular flooring material. It can be found at a thoroughly accessible price, it is practical and it is easy to look after. A variety of wood, marble and concrete designs lets you bring individuality to any shop interior.

&nbsp;

<strong>Homogeneous PVC</strong> is highly wear-resistant. The covering is hard to ignite, hypoallergenic and can be used for up to 10 years. Damage is dealt with by simple sanding.

